  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">시작은 저의 막연한 호기심이었습니다.ㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14a770e9a0cd83316b70b0d24146798735b28d92\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14a770e9a0cd83316b70b0d24146798735b28d92\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1436\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이 질문에 두 선생님께서 같이 자료를 찾아봐주신 결과<br>다음에 정말 성공해볼 수 있을 것 같아요!<br><br>1. 하바리움밀도별 용액을 판매함<br> - <a href=\"http://naver.me/xxxiOHYe\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://naver.me/xxxiOHYe</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"SG 하바리움 용액 하바리움전용용액 프리저브드플라워 프리저브드용액 하바리움만들기 : 에스지\" data-og-description=\"[SG] 에스지는 방산종합시장내 위치한 캔들, 디퓨저, 플라워 비누재료 전문 업체 입니다\" data-og-host=\"link.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"http://naver.me/xxxiOHYe\" data-og-url=\"https://link.naver.com/bridge?url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.smartstore.naver.com%2Fsgmallkr%2Fproducts%2F5416015214%3Fn_media%3D33421%26n_query%3D%25ED%2595%2598%25EB%25B0%2594%25EB%25A6%25AC%25EC%259B%2580%26n_rank%3D2%26n_ad_group%3Dgrp-a001-02-000000020164211%26n_ad%3Dnad-a001-02-000000125672393%26n_campaign_type%3D2%26n_mall_id%3Dncp_1nq3bb_01%26n_mall_pid%3D5416015214%26n_ad_group_type%3D2%26NaPm%3Dct%253Dkujgxk6g%257Cci%253D0zi0003feA5v2iVFJKZm%257Ctr%253Dpla%257Chk%253D640861967dea60db07b0451a025438dbcb692c52&amp;dst=naversearchapp%3A%2F%2Finappbrowser%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fm.smartstore.naver.com%252Fsgmallkr%252Fproducts%252F5416015214%253Fn_media%253D33421%2526n_query%253D%2525ED%252595%252598%2525EB%2525B0%252594%2525EB%2525A6%2525AC%2525EC%25259B%252580%2526n_rank%253D2%2526n_ad_group%253Dgrp-a001-02-000000020164211%2526n_ad%253Dnad-a001-02-000000125672393%2526n_campaign_type%253D2%2526n_mall_id%253Dncp_1nq3bb_01%2526n_mall_pid%253D5416015214%2526n_ad_group_type%253D2%2526NaPm%253Dct%25253Dkujgxk6g%25257Cci%25253D0zi0003feA5v2iVFJKZm%25257Ctr%25253Dpla%25257Chk%25253D640861967dea60db07b0451a025438dbcb692c52%26version%3D10%26sourceReferer%3Dshare\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/T2Qet/hyL2CE735d/948fQjl01lzrj8ft2f9dbK/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=507&amp;face=0_0_640_507\"><a href=\"http://naver.me/xxxiOHYe\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"http://naver.me/xxxiOHYe\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/T2Qet/hyL2CE735d/948fQjl01lzrj8ft2f9dbK/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=507&amp;face=0_0_640_507)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">SG 하바리움 용액 하바리움전용용액 프리저브드플라워 프리저브드용액 하바리움만들기 : 에스지</p><p class=\"og-desc\">[SG] 에스지는 방산종합시장내 위치한 캔들, 디퓨저, 플라워 비누재료 전문 업체 입니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">link.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>2. 미네랄 오일에 글리세린을 섞어 밀도차를 주는 것 같음<br><br>3. 색소는 &#39;식품용 지용성 색소&#39;를 이용!<br><br>4. 참고영상<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/wu_I2-U0xtk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/wu_I2-U0xtk</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wu_I2-U0xtk\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cMKbGB/hyL2Fu62x3/zwEjAYzgoQ01o9rLpkB4K0/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"0\" data-video-origin-height=\"0\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wu_I2-U0xtk\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이후 밀도탑쌓기 성공사례, 적용사례 등을 많은 선생님들께서 공유해주셨습니다.<br><br>* 김정식 수석님의 누구나 성공하는 밀도탑<br><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1270\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/1270</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"무지개 물탑쌓기 - 밀도실험\" data-og-description=\"본 자료는 2004 - 2008년까지 이천중학교에서 과학선도학교를 운영하면서 개발한 자료입니다. 설탕물의 농도차이(밀도차이)를 이용하고 각각의 농도에 색소를 섞으면 사진처럼 6층 물탑을 쌓는 것\" data-og-host=\"sciencelove.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1270\" data-og-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1270\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cGbqEW/hyL2HfnxnM/pL8CeZnZEHBTjqxk4FyeM1/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=623&amp;face=0_0_630_623\"><a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/1270\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sciencelove.com/1270\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cGbqEW/hyL2HfnxnM/pL8CeZnZEHBTjqxk4FyeM1/img.jpg?width=630&amp;height=623&amp;face=0_0_630_623)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">무지개 물탑쌓기 - 밀도실험</p><p class=\"og-desc\">본 자료는 2004 - 2008년까지 이천중학교에서 과학선도학교를 운영하면서 개발한 자료입니다. 설탕물의 농도차이(밀도차이)를 이용하고 각각의 농도에 색소를 섞으면 사진처럼 6층 물탑을 쌓는 것</p><p class=\"og-host\">sciencelove.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>* 음료이용</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf4b303448774aeed1918b848a98a6741a39f5f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf4b303448774aeed1918b848a98a6741a39f5f5\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1507\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">음료는 세종류지만 경계면에서 색이 섞여 좀 더 다양한 색깔층이 생긴다고 합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/11c3ed1853ba98d88a031db5d12a0f8b3431b811\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/11c3ed1853ba98d88a031db5d12a0f8b3431b811\" data-origin-width=\"1078\" data-origin-height=\"496\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">* 초등 &quot;용액의 진하기&quot; 단원에도 적용가능!<br><br>* 스포이드로 시험관을 기울여서 천천히 흘려 넣어 쌓아주면 층이 뚜렷하게 분리됨. 너무 기울이면 안됨!<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c28db44218503ee36ce61f4c2583569d2d63bb0d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c28db44218503ee36ce61f4c2583569d2d63bb0d\" data-origin-width=\"903\" data-origin-height=\"1112\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2fa471f774e67fbac09756f3a8f3684ba6c235e5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2fa471f774e67fbac09756f3a8f3684ba6c235e5\" data-origin-width=\"809\" data-origin-height=\"1690\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">* 20ml 바이알 추천. 폐기물이 덜 나옴<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c3cf0506828a6e11ab95051a8e280ec6af25cd7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c3cf0506828a6e11ab95051a8e280ec6af25cd7\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">* 코카콜라-물-제로펩시<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/931166a0d978f795ea1a8a11779c7bb6f5f23b4d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/931166a0d978f795ea1a8a11779c7bb6f5f23b4d\" data-origin-width=\"809\" data-origin-height=\"2276\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">*<a href=\"http://naver.me/5OnJiZdC\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://naver.me/5OnJiZdC</a><br><br>* 잘 안되면 설탕을 더 섞어서 확실히!<br>* 각설탕 개수로 농도조절 추천<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e00dba3cdc9f609c077e47b52ed399ebc567a2df\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e00dba3cdc9f609c077e47b52ed399ebc567a2df\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2220\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d88235e8bc1faaca465b50fb78dab6a1286ba63\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d88235e8bc1faaca465b50fb78dab6a1286ba63\" data-origin-width=\"809\" data-origin-height=\"3364\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">* 용기가 작을수록 밀도탑이 잘 만들어지나봅니다!<br><br>공유해주신 선생님들 감사합니다!</p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends2\" data-emoticon-name=\"009\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"false\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends2/large/009.png\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends2/large/009.png\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
